  "remaining_work": [
    "G6-046 remains in progress: implement persisted actual Connect vCon capture/outcome/fetch/readiness, truthful partial/unavailable state, current source/content audiences including consultations, redaction/retention and authorized link retrieval. Current Runtime::new still selects default process-local MemoryVconStore through Core Config and CanonicalHandler/StorePeerAuthority have no recording command branch. Do not expose that default memory store as durable completed integration.",
    "Implement/prove required assurance/step-up, DTMF, quality and capability events/outcomes through Connect/current public SDK. Refresh deliberately preserves identified assurance and is not a step-up substitute. The client still treats identity.assurance-changed as terminal, so legitimate verified upgrades need their own composed handling.",
    "Execute and audit all assigned auxiliary vectors through Connect, including the61 retained source clauses/shared prerequisite mappings in auxiliary-protocol-scope.json. Keep the full original work/verify scope, later designated external profiles and acceptance open."
